AUDIO: 'Olama with things like LM studio to run models locally. All right so True Forge is a MIT licensed TypeScript repo from the True Foundry team with one MPX command. You can basically spin this up.'

[09:27] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'It takes care of a local SQL light database. all your data is staying locally and it\'s running on a local host. There are also hosted modes if you want to do it with things like Postgress or Reddus and Docker, but the whole'

[09:39] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
